	(text "- slotted photo-interrupters\n- BUMP-X reads low when light passes the slot\n- drive BUMP_L/R_LED_EN PWM <<15 usec period to enable\n- tune R44, R48, LED PWM duty to let ADC sense full open/close range\n  1k keeps photo transistor output out of saturation\n  so PA4/PA5 (ADC2) see the transition (ITR9606 IC(ON) 0.5-10 mA)\n- R221 enables MCU USB-C Rd on both CC1 and CC2 during MCU *reset*,\n  so the phone detects the robot whichever way the cable is plugged in\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 104.394 118.364 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "540208bf-7a63-4da8-98c4-eccfa3679b8c")
	)
